      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Legend:  [static] = SPA assets, no server runtime (React/Vite build served from a CDN or @fastify/static, runs in the browser).  [server] = container we deploy.  [service] = managed infra (Redis, Postgres, S3).  [external] = third-party API (dashed border).  Solid = primary flow.  Dashed = secondary dependency.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend:  [static] = SPA assets, no server runtime (React/Vite build served from a CDN or @fastify/static, runs in the browser).  [server] = container we deploy.  [service] = managed infra (Redis, Postgres, S3).  [external] = third-party API (dashed border).  Solid = primary flow.  Dashed = secondary dependency.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
